    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@value": "The estimated restoration time (ERT) is the amount of time estimated to correct the outage and can have a confidence factor applied such as high or low confidence that the ERT will be accomplished. This confidence factor may be updated as needed during the outage period - just as the actual ERT can be updated.",
