        "@value": "Indication of a \u0022harmonic\u0022 or \u0022interharmonic\u0022 basis for the measurement. Value 0 in \u0027numerator\u0027 and \u0027denominator\u0027 means not applicable.",
        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#ReadingType"
